{"title":"2012 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 8","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_8\">Problem 8</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 8\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>What is the sum of all integer solutions to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/e/9/3e97fbbee3f9961bdd22dba2f270967cbf2203fa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1&lt;(x-2)^2&lt;25$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"138\" height=\"19\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/c/34cc6451fb0390669afa420d6f86835c0700aefc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 10\\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 12\\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 15\\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 19\\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 25$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"394\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/0/8/4089987a9c991bba4233d802131442ff4443263e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x-2)^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"61\" height=\"19\" /> = perfect square.\n</p><p>1 &lt; perfect square &lt; 25\n</p><p>Perfect square can equal: 4, 9, or 16\n</p><p>Solve for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/1/a/91adcfc7af2fcc8e2317ca2245816ea73449e5cf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x-2)^2=4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"96\" height=\"19\" /> \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/9/5/495fd4bdf9a17185e56e55c840ad27a0608c4826.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=4,0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"60\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p>and\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/b/1/7b1c40a3cc9cb3f5a4cf82b844bc3d8e80e39620.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x-2)^2=9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"96\" height=\"19\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/7/6/776f17d830499ea9a26ef90e87c50dff9dfcfe29.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=5,-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"74\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p>and\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/4/0/0408ad3900c55f774fefb2b3754ae47822a15b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x-2)^2=16$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"105\" height=\"19\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/3/9036839d6eac7f360718876f66a4eeee34a82c95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=6,-2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"74\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p>The sum of all integer solutions is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/b/4/2b45036ac9e226090485117ea75aa357ae49377d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4+5+6+0+(-1)+(-2)=\\boxed{\\textbf{(B)} 12}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"304\" height=\"28\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_AMC_10B\" title=\"2012 AMC 10B\">2012 AMC 10B</a></b> 